sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant API as API / batch approval
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as Daraja B2C
  API->>DB: TX: lock payable, create item PENDING, payable to in-transit, insert outbox row
  DB-->>API: commit
  W->>DB: claim outbox row (lease), record attempt
  DB-->>W: commit
  Note over W,D: crash before this commit: nothing sent, retry safe
  W->>D: B2C request (outside any DB transaction, no row locks held)
  alt response received
    D-->>W: accepted
    W->>DB: guarded update, never overwrite a terminal state
  else timeout or ambiguous
    W->>DB: mark UNKNOWN, schedule investigation
    Note over W,DB: crash after claim commits is also UNKNOWN. Never resend
  end
  D-->>API: result callback
  API->>DB: TX1 store raw evidence, commit
  API-->>D: 200
  API->>DB: TX2 lock payout, apply terminal-state guard
  alt success
    DB->>DB: Dr 2040 Cr 1000, expected fee Dr 5010 Cr 2050
  else failure
    DB->>DB: Dr 2040 Cr payable, principal return is a timing item
  end
